WEBVTT

00:00:12.609 --> 00:00:15.960
Yeah!

00:00:24.055 --> 00:00:26.275
[GIGGLES]

00:00:27.537 --> 00:00:29.669
[PANTING]

00:00:33.717 --> 00:00:37.677
BELLATRIX:
Hagrid! Hello?

00:00:37.721 --> 00:00:39.418
HARRY:
Snape!

00:00:39.462 --> 00:00:42.160
He trusted you!

00:00:42.204 --> 00:00:44.728
[LAUGHING]

00:00:44.771 --> 00:00:46.034
[SQUEALING]

00:00:46.077 --> 00:00:47.818
Go on.

00:00:47.861 --> 00:00:50.212
Incarcerous.

00:00:50.255 --> 00:00:53.041
Fight back! You coward,
fight back!

00:00:54.956 --> 00:00:57.915
SNAPE:
No! He belongs to the Dark Lord.

00:00:57.959 --> 00:00:59.961
[FIRE CRACKLING]

00:01:13.583 --> 00:01:15.541
[PANTING]

00:01:17.935 --> 00:01:19.415
Sectumsempra!

00:01:27.727 --> 00:01:30.643
You dare use my own spells

00:01:30.687 --> 00:01:33.733
against me, Potter?

00:01:33.777 --> 00:01:35.039
Yes.

00:01:35.083 --> 00:01:39.913
I'm the Half-Blood Prince.

00:01:44.570 --> 00:01:46.181
[♪♪♪]

00:01:57.496 --> 00:02:00.195
[RUMBLING]

00:02:04.590 --> 00:02:06.549
[CHATTER]

00:02:10.640 --> 00:02:12.642
[♪♪♪]

00:04:13.937 --> 00:04:16.069
[HARRY SOBBING]

